{  DelphiDoom: unit tests of the game rules of the engine (DUnitX)             }
{                                                                              }
{  One copy of the rule units of the Doom folder, compiled with the shims of   }
{  Shim\Rules where the unit needs the rest of the engine. Each test builds    }
{  its own records in memory and compares the rule with the text of the old    }
{  free routine (commit 5adaf6fb9 and the ones before it).                     }
